*
* Bundled fallback copy of cmd so git runs standalone.  When the full mv_cmd
* is installed its catalog entry overrides this copy (UniData: a global
* CATALOG overwrite; mvx: the account LIB loads before a package library), so
* GIT calls CMD.* normally and gets whichever is present.
* /**
*  * @file CMD.INIT
*  * @version 1.0
*  */
* CMD.INIT(name, description) — begin defining a command.
SUBROUTINE CMD.INIT(NAME, DESC)
COMMON /CMDPKG/ CNAME, CDESC, CSUBS, CDESCS, CHANDLERS
CNAME = NAME
CDESC = DESC
CSUBS = ""
CDESCS = ""
CHANDLERS = ""
RETURN
